<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 30-JUN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS - WSC - 30-JUN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical storm Peter left behind heavy rain and localized flooding. No major damage was reported.</p>
<p>Torrential rains continue have let up throughout most of Gujarat with Amhadhabad still receiving heavy rainfall, with more than 10 inches of rainfall this weekend.</p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
